E-Series / SANtricity notes
NetApp E-Series arrays also support NVMe/FC and NVMe/TCP. In SANtricity, validate:

NVMe over Fabrics enabled
Host NQNs configured correctly
Volumes mapped to host or host group
FC zoning / TCP connectivity validated
Troubleshooting Flow
Confirm host can resolve target
Check physical connectivity
Validate fabric or network path
Verify host NQN is present in subsystem
Verify namespace is present and mapped
Confirm port and interface status
Check logs for kernel, switch, array, or fabric errors
Validate firmware and driver compatibility
